## What Nise did not do

It did not edit a single file it had not just written ([ADR
0026](../../../docs/adr/0026-feature-generation-writes-only-new-files.md)). The
lines to add to `internal/app/app.go` and the rest were printed by the command;
apply them yourself, so every change to a file you own is a change in your own
